## Reconstruction direction

The expanded target restores the complete public roster instead of compressing the perfume into a 23-row woody-lavender chassis. Cardamom is integrated into the target. Separate woods, musks, ionone, moss, green, aldehydic, and rose-ketone functions remain explicit.

## Chassis equation

\[
4500 = 4200\;\text{µL fixed core} + 300\;\text{µL parent module}
\]

The target hypothesis contains 45 µL cardamom oil. The core retains 18 µL, while 27 µL is assigned to the parent module. An alternative module therefore modifies cardamom rather than replacing its entire presence.

